e journal branch."],["da8416d6_ac66fbeb",87,0,1,"Use the more direct check: `EXPECT_TRUE(actor_keyed_service()->GetTask(task_id)->GetTabs().contains(new_tab));`"],["dd961c45_af520800",87,0,1,"Doesn't this need to be a string? In any case...we should probably return null or throw to ensure we return base::unexpected?"]],0,330],[7243531,20434,61,1.341,1.058,[[14,0.797,34,49],[4,0.203,39,12]],[["0d216b08_91d3e967",88,-2,1,"Task can be null. (there is a check in AKS::PerformActions for this)."],["44024d4d_987a68e9",88,-2,1,"Lets add a journal entry here that we're attempting to reload a crashed tab."],["4adead1c_6618300b",1,-2,1,"remember to add merge bug"],["045f04fb_fbbd4f89",88,-1,1,"I don't think the details add much here, we could just use {}"],["eeacdf9f_ee0347ef",49,-1,1,"for internal bugs it's ok to use b/ despite the warning (crbug.com forces you to go through a signin interstitial first)"]],0,331],[7254103,20434,3,0.258,0.202,[[21,4]],[],0,332],[7255898,20437,16,0.737,0.556,[[14,35]],[["8e41f86b_0e1f462a",1,-3,1,"nit: Have something more descriptive as the first line of the commit message."]],0,333],[7265665,20438,4,0.259,0.185,[[26,1]],[["07fadec5_9fa07392",89,0,1,"update this line too (or just remove it)"]],0,334],[7261639,20440,11,0.318,0.229,[[28,0]],[],0,335],[7260143,20441,58,0.82,0.522,[[29,1]],[["58446748_bee4a77f",90,-3,1,"For clarity and precision, the destination span should be sized to `pixel_num * 3` to match the number of bytes written by `convertToRGB`."]],0,336],[7302705,20444,125,2.361,1.866,[[14,0.826,37,106],[4,0.081,41,9],[20,0.054,23,6],[25,0.02,1,2],[8,0.02,9,2]],[["42701bca_d5bace9e",1,0,1,"nit: this is fixing snake_case to CamelCase rather than anything about `for_testing`."]],0,338],[7301982,20445,212,4.21,3.407,[[14,0.772,38,169],[20,0.125,24,27],[0,0.04,12,7],[8,0.036,10,7],[30,0.027,0,4]],[["3e9499a7_01c8caa0",68,0,1,"these should probably be behind a finch param in case it changes? are we firm about the tiers we are launching to? (